-- Passport assessment EVERY order as signed displacement predicate (`ChartDiag` comparing true minus false). struct uses all. supports quantitative when requiring at least ONE reordered gap for axis (could extend cost to ANY strict charts with projection aperture but this detector asks same plenum region). 
structure Breezeway (X: Bool→ Vantage)(c w U:ℝ) : Prop where
 shelter : ∀ j:Axis,w*c ≤ |X false j-X true j| ∧ |X false j-X true j| ≤ U*c
